cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata.
title: StepUp Queue
type: software
url: https://reproducible-reporting.github.io/stepup-queue
abstract: >-
  StepUp Queue is an experimental StepUp
  extension to integrate queued jobs into a workflow.
  It currently supports integration with SLURM
  and is designed to be extensible to other job schedulers.
